# A piece built by hand, five minutes of Load Screen in Hands, as it powers on: the keys and the pad; each layer brought in with its switch, the drums entering sparse; Energy the density, the whole way, and no silence in it; EDIT and a called break; and back down to the keys. Fixed seed; app/build/listen/hands.trace has each bar. Not one of the tests.
#   PYTHON=.venv/bin/python3 sh build.sh --host && mkdir -p app/build/listen && app/build/host/aq1_host tests/listen/hands.amb app/build/listen
# (Energy 20 kept for the start: it is the only thing done before the first note)
energy 20
expect par1 20
wait 100
tap SAVE
wait 800
reboot
seed 2026
master 2430
trace app/build/listen/hands.trace
wav hands.wav
# 0:00 the keys and the pad alone
wait 20000
# 0:20 SELECT + ARP: the melody, its phrase within a couple of bars, over a second
press SEL
tap ARP
release SEL
wait 20000
# 0:40 SELECT + LFO: the bass, on the bar
press SEL
tap LFO
release SEL
wait 20000
# 1:00 SELECT + FX: the hats, by themselves, on the bar
press SEL
tap FX
release SEL
wait 20000
# 1:20 SELECT + SEQ: the drums, on the bar: half time at Energy 20
press SEL
tap SEQ
release SEL
wait 30000
# 1:50 Energy 48: the light rhythm. Nothing else turned on or off
energy 48
expect par1 48
wait 25000
# 2:15 SELECT + EDIT: a break; Breaks at 50: two bars
press SEL
tap EDIT
release SEL
wait 10000
# 2:25 Energy 72: the full rhythm
energy 72
expect par1 72
wait 25000
# 2:50 EDIT: to the breakdown: a new chord on the bar, a new groove, a calmer colour, a sparer melody. The drums stay full, Energy's
tap EDIT
wait 15000
# 3:05 EDIT: to the full section: the harmony at its peak, the melody at its busiest
tap EDIT
wait 15000
# 3:20 SELECT + SEQ: the drums out, on the bar: hats, bass, melody, keys
press SEL
tap SEQ
release SEL
wait 10000
# 3:30 SELECT + SEQ: the drums back, on the bar; SELECT + ENV: the keys out, over a second
press SEL
tap SEQ
tap ENV
release SEL
wait 10000
# 3:40 SELECT + ENV: the keys back
press SEL
tap ENV
release SEL
wait 5000
# 3:45 Breaks at 100, SELECT + EDIT: a four-bar break
breaks 100
press SEL
tap EDIT
release SEL
wait 15000
# 4:00 Energy 0: still a beat, sparse
energy 0
wait 20000
# 4:20 the drums, hats and bass out, on one bar
press SEL
tap SEQ
tap FX
tap LFO
release SEL
wait 10000
# 4:30 the melody out, over a second: the keys and the pad, as it began
press SEL
tap ARP
release SEL
wait 30000
# 5:00
wavstop
trace off
expect mode 1
expect par1 0
